    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i've tried talking. it just feels like i'm explaining colors to someone who's blind. like, how do you even explain a void? it's not even a \"sad\" feeling, it's just... nothingness. it feels like i'm just spectating my own life instead of living it. it’s like i’m waiting for something to happen but i know deep down nothing ever will. it just feels so permanent.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
